                    title:                  `Stock Smart`,
                    subtitle:               `Fill rate has slipped to 91.4% against a contractual 97%, yet €31M of inventory is trapped and turns have fallen to 3.6. Low service and high stock at the same time — the signature of inventory at the wrong echelon. Reposition safety stock across the Tilburg CDC and four regional points to hold service above target without adding a euro of working capital. Fail, and the board outsources planning to a 3PL.`,
                    header_tag:             `9 March 2026 · Noordveld Components B.V. · Tilburg · one S&OP cycle to fix it`,
                    round_label:            `Round`,
                    period_of:              `of`,
                    decisions_heading:      `Your Planning Decisions This Round`,
                    submit_btn:             `Commit the Policy`,
                    undo_btn:               `Undo Last Round`,
                    history_heading:        `Round-by-Round Planning Record`,
                    chart_heading:          `Service vs. Working Capital Trajectory`,
                    chart_start:            `Now`,
                    coach_header:           `Facilitator (the board & your three largest accounts)`,
                    coach_intro:            `Your three biggest accounts — 38% of revenue — opened the quarterly review with a complaint: fill rate is 91.4% against a 97% promise, and a third missed quarter ends the relationship. Finance says inventory is €31M and turns have fallen to 3.6. Low service and high stock at once is not bad luck — it is stock at the wrong echelon. You have one S&OP cycle and a hard constraint: fix service without adding a single euro of working capital. The €5.8M of dead RSP buffer is your funding source. Redeploy it — don’t stack new stock on top of it.`,

                    node_cdc:               `CDC · Tilburg`,
                    node_cdc_meta:          `Central DC · 6,200 SKUs · pools demand variability · +1 transfer day to regions`,
                    node_rsp:               `4 RSPs · Rotterdam · Eindhoven · Antwerp · Düsseldorf`,
                    node_rsp_meta:          `Regional stocking points · fast/medium movers · the 24-hour promise · buffered four times over`,

                    fill_label:             `Fill Rate`,
                    fill_sub:               `Line-item availability within 24h · contract 97% · penalty below 95%`,
